Valid Queues:
- technical_defect: Hardware malfunction, hydraulic oil leak, valve crack, pressure drop, sensor error, vibration, or structural damage.
- order_delivery: Shipping delay, tracking number inquiry, customs clearance, missing delivery note, consignment status.
- returns_rma: Return merchandise authorization, damaged goods return, warranty claim, wrong part delivered.
- billing_inquiry: Disputed price, incorrect VAT, duplicate invoice, payment terms, or credit memo request.
- general_inquiry: Technical data sheet, CAD model, ISO 4413 compliance certificate, or catalog request.
- other: Out-of-scope inquiries, spam, catering, or non-technical facility messages.

Valid Priorities:
- critical: Production line stoppage, safety hazard, severe high-pressure oil spraying, or immediate financial block.
- high: Machine down, urgent warranty return, transit damage, or contract price dispute.
- medium: Normal replacement request, certificate required for scheduled audit, or tracking inquiry.
- low: General catalog download, CAD request, or informational message.

Return structured JSON conforming to the schema.
